11. Telemetry Quality
AI systems are only as reliable as their telemetry.

Potential problems include:
- missing records;
- duplicate records;
- inconsistent timestamps;
- malformed IP addresses;
- schema changes;
- collector overload;
- packet sampling;
- clock synchronization errors.
Students should therefore calculate:
Completeness
\[
Completeness =
\frac{valid\ events}{expected\ events}
\]
Duplicate rate
\[
DuplicateRate =
\frac{duplicate\ events}{total\ events}
\]
