11. Safety Controls
Autonomous response should implement:
Rate limits
Prevent repeated actions.
Circuit breakers
Stop automation when unexpected behavior occurs.
Rollback
Return systems to a known safe state.
Approval gates
Require humans for high-impact actions.
Audit logging
Record every decision.
Idempotency
Repeating an action should not cause progressively worse effects.
12. Audit Event
